/* ============================================================
   PLAYMONA — data/logos.js
   Every brand in Logo Rush. Logo files live in
   assets/images/games/logoRush/: <id>.svg|webp is the symbol
   (never the name), <id>-full.svg|webp the full logo shown at
   the reveal. Where each file came from: tools/logos/sources.json.

   Row: [id, name, category, tier, fact, aliases, alike, opts]
     tier 1 = most children know it (Easy), 2 = most adults
     (Normal adds), 3 = fans and experts (Hard adds).
     aliases: other names a player may type (never another brand's).
     alike: brands whose symbol is easy to mix up (Hard decoys).
     opts: africa (an African brand), bg ('dark' when the logo
     needs a dark tile), crop ([x, y, w, h] percent of the full
     logo, for brands that only have a wordmark).
   Logos are trademarks of their owners, shown so players can name them.
   Classic script, ES5.
   ============================================================ */
